<title>USA: Nash Finch sets dividend.</title>
<headline>Nash Finch sets dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nash Finch Co said Tuesday it has declared a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.18 a share and a special year end dividend of $0.03 a share.</p>
<p>The total dividend is payable December 13 to sharehodlers of record November 29.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
